# local QA scratch: the CDP screenshot driver, step scripts, the dev-server log
# and every raw capture. Nothing here is a source file, and 100+ PNGs would
# otherwise land in the next `git add -A`.
/.perch/

# QA screenshots. Every capture folder is reviewed by a human once and then dies
# with the browser session, so none of it belongs in version control — these are
# 100+ PNGs per feature and they only ever bloat a clone. The written record of
# what was checked stays in docs/qa/**/README.md, which is NOT ignored.
/.perch
/docs/**/*.png
/docs/**/*.jpg
/docs/**/*.jpeg
/docs/**/*.webp
# stray Windows-absolute paths that some tooling creates inside the repo root
/C:/
*.pdb

